{
  "id": 88036398,
  "iid": 2046,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix identify command",
  "description": "This fixes parsing of Identify command with NVME-RDMA.\n\nIdentify command has the following dissection problem:\n- dissector thinks CNS is 2 bytes, while it is 1 bytes\n- dissector does not decode CNS\n- dissector thinks reserved field is 2 bytes, while it is 1 byte\n- dissector thinks CNTID is 4 byes, while it is 2 byes. CNTDID is shifted by 2 bytes because of the above.\n- DWORD-11 is not decoded (NVMESETID)\n- DWORD-14 is not decoded (UUID index)\n\nThis patch fixes these issues.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-02-10T12:46:34.615Z",
  "updated_at": "2021-02-12T05:22:47.809Z",
